             Imaging and Vision</b></i>,  Vol. <b>24</b>, pp.
             177-194, 2006; with Q. Du, M. Gunzburger and X. Wang.
             </li>
       
       <li> ``A numerical method for exact boundary controllability
            problems for the 2-D wave equation'', <i><b>Computer & Mathematics with 
            Applications</b></i>, Vol. 
            <b>51</b>, pp. 721-750, 2006; with M. Gunzburger and L.S. Hou.
            </li>

       <li> ``Adaptive finite element methods for elliptic PDEs based on conforming
            centroidal Voronoi Delaunay triangulations'', <i><b>SIAM Journal on Scientific 
            Computing</b></i>,
            Vol. <b>28</b>, pp. 2023-2053, 2006; with M. Gunzburger and W.-D. Zhao.
            </li>       

       <li> ``Conforming centroidal Voronoi Delaunay triangulation for
             quality mesh generation'', <i><b>International Journal of Numerical Analysis and 
