              with Qiang Du.
             <!--<a href="../my_papers/sci_fvmgs.pdf" "target="frame2"> [pdf]</a>-->
             </li>

       <li> ``A posteriori error estimates for finite volume approximations of
              elliptic equations on general surfaces'', <i><b>Computer Methods in Applied Mechanics
