             <!--<a href="../my_papers/sci_fvmgsbi.pdf" "target="frame2"> [pdf]</a>-->
             </li>


       <li> ``Adaptive finite volume methods for steady convection-diffusion
              equations with mesh optimization'',  <i><b> Discrete and Continuous Dynamical
              Systems B</b></i>, Vol. <b>11</b>, pp. 669-690, 2009; with W. Wu and W.-D. Zhao.
             <!--<a href="../my_papers/sci_afvm4cd.pdf" "target="frame2"> [pdf]</a>-->
              </li>

       <li> ``Adaptive anisotropic meshing for steady  convection-dominated problems'',
             <i><b>Computer Methods in Applied Mechanics
            and Engineering</b></i>,
             Vol. <b>198</b>, pp. 2964-2981, 2009; with H. Nguyen, J. Burkardt and M. Gunzburger.
             <!--<a href="../my_papers/sci_acvt.pdf" "target="frame2"> [pdf]</a>--></li>


      <li> ``An edge-weighted centroidal Voronoi tessellation model for image
